    "media:imagetext": "From the Illimitable\nrestrial Firmament,\nCupiter Pier\nthe Heavens, Lord of the Sun, Moon,\nStars and Nebulae, Ruler of the Winds and Weather,\nMaster of Lightning and Thunder; Supreme Potentate of\nall things above the Surface of the Earth\nKnow All Ye By These Presents That:\nCLYDE J SMITH\non this_\nMarch in tbe year of 1954\nPAA\nThe System of the Flying Clippers\nwas borne on the wings of a Clipper of the\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS\nacross the Equator enroute from _\nHonolulu o_\nCanton Island\nAnd, therefore, let it be known that said passenger has been\naccepted into the Empyrean Realm of His Exalted Majesty Jupiter Rex and\nshall receive the profound Privileges and Immunities of our Aerial Realm.\nGiven Under My Hand and Seal\n0. Busch\naptain and Plenipotentiary Extraordinary R.0.J.R",
